'''tricorporate''' (trī-kôr′pọ̄-rāt), ''a.'' [ having three bodies, + ''-ate''<sup>1</sup>.] I three bodies with only one head common to the three: as, a lion ''tricorporate.'' {{smaller|The head is usually in the center of the field, and the bodies radiate, two toward the dexter and sinister chiefs, the third toward the base.}}

'''tricorporated''' (trī-kôr′pọ̄-rā-ted), ''a.'' [< ''tricorporate'' + ''-ed''<sup>2</sup>.] In ''her.'', same as ''tricorporate.''
